  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.1 - built-in observability: metrics and traces on a BCL Meter and ActivitySource named \"TUIKit\" (render stages, input routing, commands, post queue, modals, session lifecycle, clipboard/file-system integrations, errors). No exporter dependency. See TELEMETRY.md. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
